    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme go ile go le bjalo: ge kgoši a bona ⟨את⟩ Ester kgosigadi a ema sekgobeng, a hwetša mohau mahlong a yena; gomme kgoši a olletša go Ester ⟨את⟩ thupa ya gauta yeo e lego seatleng sa yena; gomme Ester a atamela, a kgoma hlogo ya thupa.",
